Package: oceancube
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Multidimensional Ocean Data Cubes
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-02
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Elmer",
           family = "Quispe-Salazar",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "qselmer@gmail.com")
Description: Represents multidimensional ocean data with a canonical
    longitude, latitude, depth, time, and variable contract. In-memory and
    read-only local 'NetCDF' backends support validation, inspection,
    selection, extraction, visualization, temporal aggregation,
    climatologies, anomalies, descriptive per-cell temporal trends, polygon
    masks, grid geometry, and polygon weights for downstream marine analyses.
